# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit game data. This repository must stay ROM-free.
# 絕對不要提交遊戲資料，本專案必須保持不含 ROM。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.wsc
*.ws
*.sav
*.srm
*.ieeprom
*.eeprom

# Third-party documents (e.g. other people's FAQs / translations of them)
# 第三方文件（例如他人攻略及其翻譯）
guide.txt
guide_*.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output - the .exe is published as a GitHub Release asset, not committed
# 打包產物 - exe 以 GitHub Release 發布，不進版控
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.spec

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
